{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01205",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.56,
      "end_seconds": 3.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Hi, sit anywhere you like."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.97,
      "end_seconds": 11.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "Well, hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.24,
      "end_seconds": 14.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.94,
      "end_seconds": 31.22,
      "duration_seconds": 15.28,
      "text": "Yeah, it's skipped beats. I don't know what's causing it. I've been putting this off for weeks. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.81,
      "end_seconds": 35.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.5,
      "end_seconds": 50.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.53,
      "end_seconds": 69.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 85 beats a minute, pressure 109 over 71."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.64,
      "end_seconds": 73.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Well, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.25,
      "end_seconds": 81.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly. Okay, how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.86,
      "end_seconds": 86.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "About... well, two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.95,
      "end_seconds": 92.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.24,
      "end_seconds": 101.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.65,
      "text": "It, It comes and goes. Severe, really. Yes, lying down and caffeine. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.85,
      "end_seconds": 107.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Have you noticed shortness of breath or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.41,
      "end_seconds": 115.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Actually, no, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.02,
      "end_seconds": 119.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Has there been any dizziness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.48,
      "end_seconds": 124.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Mm, um, no, none, no dizziness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.9,
      "end_seconds": 127.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.39,
      "end_seconds": 130.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.43,
      "end_seconds": 134.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.11,
      "end_seconds": 136.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.01,
      "end_seconds": 151.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.04,
      "end_seconds": 154.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.67,
      "end_seconds": 157.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.75,
      "end_seconds": 160.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.88,
      "end_seconds": 163.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.0,
      "end_seconds": 171.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Herbal calming tea, in the evening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.04,
      "end_seconds": 175.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.1,
      "end_seconds": 180.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.11,
      "end_seconds": 184.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.0,
      "end_seconds": 188.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.0,
      "end_seconds": 209.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.01,
      "end_seconds": 215.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Yes, milk, it gives me a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.88,
      "end_seconds": 221.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.01,
      "end_seconds": 223.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.22,
      "end_seconds": 227.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.15,
      "end_seconds": 247.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Your pulse is regular and your heart sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.26,
      "end_seconds": 248.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.54,
      "end_seconds": 256.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.24,
      "end_seconds": 276.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I'd lean towards harmless extra heartbeats."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.41,
      "end_seconds": 303.81,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "I'm going to order an ECG, for palpitations. Cut back on coffee and energy drinks and keep a diary of when it happens."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.3,
      "end_seconds": 313.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "text": "Right, right. I'd like you back if it carries on after a month. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.94,
      "end_seconds": 317.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}